Fri Nov 27 00:18:06 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.5.3
  * `SpinSymClassFusion` returns `fail` for unsupported pairs of
    tables instead of raising an error; its messages are now
    printed via the new info class `InfoSpinSym` (warnings via
    `InfoWarning`).
  * Notify CTblLib of all character tables in one call, which makes
    loading SpinSym about 45 ms faster.

